00:19:58,721 --> 00:20:02,960
to optimize airflow during supersonic flight,

251
00:20:03,060 --> 00:20:08,160
a design known as an OG delta wing.

252
00:20:08,260 --> 00:20:10,560
The Concorde's engineers performed exhaustive wind

