00:20:14,360 --> 00:20:16,080
In order to get it to work efficiently

255
00:20:16,180 --> 00:20:19,580
at supersonic speed, it had to be tailored very carefully

256
00:20:19,680 --> 00:20:23,520
to the particular shape of the flow.

